# Architecture

`AGENTS.md` is the source of truth for this repo — read it before substantive changes.

Quick guardrails (details and examples in `AGENTS.md`):

- Layers: `api` → league modules / `soccer` → `db` → host use cases → `commands`
- Dispatch via `League` enum methods; `season::resolve(conn, guild_id, league)` picks the target season in gameplay use cases
- No per-guild default season: commands take an optional `league` choice, inferred only when one season is live
- Poller uses live seasons (`polling_enabled`); one live season per league per guild
